---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro'; import Breadcrumbs from '../../components/Breadcrumbs.astro';
---
<Layout title="Admission Information | NAC-MIT Dhamtari" description="Understand admission steps, batch timings and documents to ask about at NAC-MIT Computer Training Center."><Breadcrumbs current="Admission information"/><section class="container py-12"><p class="eyebrow">Before you join</p><h1 class="mt-3 max-w-3xl text-5xl">Admission information, kept simple.</h1><div class="mt-12 grid gap-5 md:grid-cols-3"><article class="border-t-4 border-brand-yellow bg-brand-mist p-7"><span class="text-4xl font-bold">01</span><h2 class="mt-5 text-2xl">Choose a course</h2><p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-brand-muted">Review the course details, eligibility and fee, then ask about current availability.</p></article><article class="border-t-4 border-brand-blue bg-brand-mist p-7"><span class="text-4xl font-bold">02</span><h2 class="mt-5 text-2xl">Confirm details</h2><p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-brand-muted">Call or visit the institute to confirm schedule, duration, examination fee and documents.</p></article><article class="border-t-4 border-brand-yellow bg-brand-mist p-7"><span class="text-4xl font-bold">03</span><h2 class="mt-5 text-2xl">Visit the centre</h2><p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-brand-muted">Direct admission information is available at Karmchari Bhawan, Kachahari Chowk.</p></article></div><div class="mt-12 grid gap-12 md:grid-cols-2"><div><h2 class="text-3xl">Available batches</h2><ul class="mt-5 grid gap-3 text-brand-muted"><li class="border-b border-brand-line pb-3">8:00 AM to 10:00 AM</li><li class="border-b border-brand-line pb-3">10:00 AM to 12:00 PM</li><li class="border-b border-brand-line pb-3">1 hour theory + 1 hour practical</li></ul></div><div><h2 class="text-3xl">Ask about documents</h2><p class="mt-5 leading-7 text-brand-muted">Course-specific document requirements can vary. Confirm what to bring when you call the institute.</p></div></div></section></Layout>